---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/loren-floral.jpg';
import event from '../assets/event.jpg';
import ServiceRows from '../components/ServiceRows.astro';
import MotionGallery from '../components/MotionGallery.astro';
---
<Base title="Meet Loren Michaels Harris" description="Meet the speaker, coach, writer, and Bathrobe Moments host behind the P3 framework: Pain, Perspective, Possibility. Watch Loren’s story, published by Goalcast.">
<section class="wrap about-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">MEET LOREN MICHAELS HARRIS</p><h1>A life lived.<br/>A voice<br/><span class="gold-text">worth sharing.</span></h1><p>Speaker. Coach. Keynote writer. Host of Bathrobe Moments. Loren’s work begins with a belief that our experiences can become a way to connect with other people.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#story">Hear Loren’s story ↓</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Start a conversation ↗</a></div></div><figure class="reveal"><Image src={portrait} alt="Loren smiling beside a window in a colourful floral shirt" widths={[400,700,1000]} sizes="(max-width:767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 46vw" format="webp" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>From Loren’s portrait collection.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="section light-section" id="story"><div class="wrap"><div class="split story-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE MESSAGE</p><h2>What we live through<br/>can help us reach<br/>someone else.</h2></div><div><p>Loren’s own journey includes foster care and finding his voice as a speaker. That experience informs how he talks about adversity, self-understanding, and the stories people carry into a room.</p><p>In this film published by Goalcast, he shares a personal story about his mother and the meaning of connection.</p></div></div></div></section>
<MotionGallery title="Hear the perspective. Meet the person." clips={[
{title:'A True Mother’s Day Miracle',source:'LOREN’S STORY · GOALCAST',videoId:'NHeQafrmpG8',poster:'/media/goalcast.jpg'},
{title:'Dr. Loren Michaels Harris · Speaker Reel',source:'ON STAGE',src:'/media/loren-speaker-reel.mp4',poster:'/media/loren-speaker-reel.webp'},
{title:'The Power of We Symposium · Chicago, 2022',source:'IN THE ROOM',videoId:'4PyakES8UQ0',poster:'/media/power-of-we.jpg'}]}/>
<section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE P3 FRAMEWORK</p><h2>Pain. Perspective.<br/><span class="gold-text">Possibility.</span></h2><p class="p3-intro">Three ideas connect Loren’s work onstage and in coaching: name the experience, consider what it means, and choose what to do with it.</p><div class="topic-columns"><article><p class="eyebrow">01 / PAIN</p><h3>Name the experience.</h3><p>Start with the challenge, loss, or limitation that shapes how you see yourself and how you show up.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">02 / PERSPECTIVE</p><h3>Look again.</h3><p>Explore the lessons, strengths, and questions inside that experience. Give yourself room to see it differently.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">03 / POSSIBILITY</p><h3>Choose your next step.</h3><p>Consider the message you want to share and a practical action you can take.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section light-section"><div class="wrap split"><figure class="reveal"><Image src={event} alt="Loren with participants in a group photograph at a community gathering" widths={[400,770]} sizes="(max-width:767px) calc(100vw - 40px), 46vw" format="webp" loading="lazy"/><figcaption class="metadata">A community gathering from Loren’s published photo collection.</figcaption></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">CONNECTION IS THE WORK</p><h2>In the room.<br/>In the conversation.</h2><p>Onstage, Loren brings his story into conversations with teams, educators, and communities. In coaching and writing, the work becomes personal: finding the message, giving it structure, and learning how to share it.</p><p>Bathrobe Moments extends that curiosity into conversations with people whose work and lives offer another way of seeing.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/bathrobe-moments/">Watch Bathrobe Moments ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read Loren’s words ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">WORK WITH LOREN</p><h2>Bring your room.<br/>Your story. Your question.</h2><ServiceRows/></section>
</Base>
<style>.about-hero figure img{height:auto;max-height:none}.story-intro{align-items:start;margin-bottom:48px}.p3-intro{max-width:760px;color:var(--muted)}</style>
